# wear/woman/robe_sleeve_r: the robe's wide sleeve over her right forearm: cloth1, the accent cuff flaring a pixel out
# and down beside the hand (front and back) or trailing it (sides); the arm library's own shading kept, the hand bare
# One view per key of the woman's arm library (arms/adult/loco and arms/adult/pose woman_r / woman_l), on the same origin:
# a new arm key needs its view here too (the arm's forearm pixels recoloured in the sleeve's ramp, the hand left bare).
# GARB-W (P2b wave 2). Fitted to one body (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role garment robe
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys armR
side R
z 1

